CLAUDE.md
# Every E2E artifact is generated and may carry credentials or key material.
# Ignore the whole directory and re-admit only the README, so a new sibling
# file is covered by default. The previous rule named the uat/ subdirectory
# only, which left pool-handle.json — five plaintext account passwords —
# untracked but committable.
tests/artifacts/*
!tests/artifacts/README.md
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
